# Using Indexes as &quot;Memory Assists.&quot;

**Authors:** Clever, Elaine C.

## Abstract
Reports findings of two research projects conducted at Temple University that investigated the usefulness of indexes as &quot;memory assists&quot; in locating specific items: title searching in the Social Science Index and the Humanities Index and author searches in those indexes and the Social Science Citation Index. Comparative performances are tabulated. (JD)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ212811

